#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_ge_hr_payroll
msgid ""
"\n"
"Georgia Payroll Rules\n"
"=====================\n"
"- Funded pension (Law on Funded Pensions of 2018): 2% employee and 2% employer of the taxable salary, without\n"
"  ceiling, for the participants; the State co-financing (2% up to GEL 24,000 a year, 1% up to 60,000) shown for\n"
"  information\n"
"- Personal income tax withheld at source (Tax Code, art. 81, 82 and 154): 20% of the salary less the employee\n"
"  pension contribution, or the rate of the income tax regime of the company (international and R&D service\n"
"  companies, innovative start-ups, Free Industrial Zone), less the annual privileges of GEL 3,000 and 6,000 of the\n"
"  employee used cumulatively over the calendar year\n"
"- Labour Code: sick leave paid by the employer, severance of 1 or 2 months depending on the departure reason and\n"
"  the notice period, unused annual leave paid on the departure, deductions within 50% of the net pay\n"
"- Net salary basis: income tax and pension borne by the employer, grossed up\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model_terms:hr.salary.rule,note:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.l10n_ge_rule_pension_employer
msgid ""
"2% of the taxable salary paid by the employer for the participants (Law on "
"Funded Pensions, art. 3(6)(a)). Not salary income (Tax Code, art. "
"101(3)(d)). Paid with the employee share on the account of the Pension Fund "
"by the 15th of the following month."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model_terms:hr.salary.rule,note:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.l10n_ge_rule_pension_employee
msgid ""
"2% of the taxable salary paid, withheld for the participants of the funded "
"pension scheme (Law on Funded Pensions, art. 3(6)(b)), without ceiling: "
"column 8 of the declaration of tax withheld at source. Exempt from the "
"income tax (Tax Code, art. 82(1)(b3))."
msgstr ""

