#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.field_res_company__l10n_ge_tax_regime
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ge_tax_regime
msgid ""
"Standard Company: income tax of 20% (Tax Code, art. 79, 81 and 101).\n"
"International Company (ICS): 5% (Tax Code, art. 23(7)).\n"
"R&D Service Company: 5% (Law on Innovations, art. 15^7).\n"
"Innovative Start-up: salary exempt up to GEL 10,000 a month in the years 1 to 3 of the status, 20% on the excess, then 5% in the years 4 to 6 and 10% in the years 7 to 10 (Law on Innovations, art. 15^3).\n"
"Innovative SME and Virtual Zone Person (VZP): 20%, no reduced rate on the salaries.\n"
"Free Industrial Zone (FIZ): no income tax withheld (Law on Free Industrial Zones), the employees pay their 4% pension contribution themselves."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.res_config_settings_view_form
