msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ge_hr_payroll
#: model_terms:hr.salary.rule,note:l10n_ge_hr_payroll.l10n_ge_rule_income_tax
msgid ""
"Tax withheld at source on the payment (Tax Code, art. 154), at the rate of "
"the income tax regime of the company (payroll settings): 20% (art. 81), 5% "
"for an international or R&amp;D service company, the innovative start-up "
"rates, nothing in a Free Industrial Zone. The base is the taxable salary "
"less the employee pension contribution and less the part of the annual "
"privilege of GEL 3,000 or 6,000 of the employee (art. 82(2)) used by the "
"period, applied cumulatively from 1 January on the certificate of the "
"Revenue Service (Instruction on Tax Administration, art. 38(7)). Declared "
"with the form II-06 and paid by the 15th of the following month."
msgstr ""

