msgid ""
"Taxable income not taxed each calendar year, applied at this employer on the certificate of the Revenue Service (form II-082) (Tax Code, art. 82(2)):\n"
"GEL 3,000: war veterans, 'Mother of Georgia', single parents, adopters for one year, foster parents.\n"
"GEL 6,000: persons with a disability from childhood or a severe or significant disability, persons seriously injured in peacekeeping operations.\n"
"GEL 6,000 (high-mountain settlement): permanent residents of a high-mountain settlement on the income of the work there."
msgstr ""

